**Ai.** An amnesiac psychic evading the mysterious men in black who
hunt her. Ai awoke in an alley with no memory of who she was. As she
wandered Tokyo trying to survive, she discovered she could sense
others' thoughts and emotions, and even move objects with her mind.
Worse, she found herself doggedly pursued by strange, unsettling men
in black suits. Shy and withdrawn, Ai struggles to connect with people
and finds it hard to put her feelings into words. She'd rather avoid a
problem than face it -- though her real trouble is that she has
nowhere left to run. *Art of Invisibility +2, Attack (Telekinetic
Power) +1, Barrier +3 [Perks: No Gesture; 5 Endurance] (provides an
alternate Defense Roll (the second Defense value below)), Dexterous
+2, Knowledge (String Games) +1, Psychic +3, Quick +2, Sixth Sense +3,
Telekinesis +3; Amnesia -3, Fear (Men in Black Suits) -2, Frail -2,
Pacifist -1, Shy -3, Wanted (Men in Black) -3, Weak -1.* Telekinetic
Push (No Gesture, Ranged, Stunning; Ineffective, Low Penetration):
Roll 2, DX 4, End 5. Ai lashes out with her telekinetic powers,
pushing the target away. Mind Break (Armor Piercing, Fatiguing, No
Gesture, Ranged, Will Attack; Cancel: Unliving (-5)): Roll 2, DX 5,
End 5. Ai fills another's mind with a confusing din of psychic energy,
draining the opponent. Defense 4/5. Health 20, Endurance 40. TV 10.

